'''Beela '''was a young [[human]] [[Gender|girl]] who was the daughter of [[Kellen]] and [[Aneth]], owners of the [[Mina-Rau General Store]]. Aneth told Beela to avoid [[Wilmon Paak]], but she still regularly visited him with water and supplies.<ref name="Beela">{{Databank|beela|Beela}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

